@Op4P_Accepted.accepted_pair_claims_op34 : ∀ {W A E M Cv : Type} {N : ℕ}
  (L : S2Trust.Library W (ℕ → S2W_D189Entry.Record)),
  S2Trust.S2TrustedSdkBorrow L →
